   FILE DESCRIPTION: Equipment Detail (Predictive View) page (Volume P1 §2).
     Sensor data, model outputs, and health trend for one asset. Built from
     the canonical Shared component library (CardComponent,
     StatusIndicatorComponent, ErrorBoundaryComponent, LoadingIndicatorComponent).
